        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUTE and RELAXING MERGE PUZZLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hot pot game is a new generation of drop and merge puzzle with cute foods at cozy atmosphere.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914400/extras/8eb7cc2d48bebe2850dba5147a8340a3.poster.avif?t=1781620033\" width=680 height=670 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914400/extras/8eb7cc2d48bebe2850dba5147a8340a3.webm?t=1781620033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914400/extras/8eb7cc2d48bebe2850dba5147a8340a3.mp4?t=1781620033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OVER 50 UNIQUE ITEMS HELP YOU MAKE the BEST HOT POT EVER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level increase provides you the choice of three items help you much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover synergies, utilize them effectively, and solve the tough situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pencils for drawing obstacle lines </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slingshots for blowing objects off </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Air pumps for making object bigger </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magnets that attracts objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914400/extras/d012caddd8ec423455421b183fbc1523.poster.avif?t=1781620033\" width=412 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914400/extras/d012caddd8ec423455421b183fbc1523.webm?t=1781620033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914400/extras/d012caddd8ec423455421b183fbc1523.mp4?t=1781620033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> Some has incredible power that changes even game rules...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914400/extras/6267ede8dcd990e2aad1cc4378ae80b2.poster.avif?t=1781620033\" width=680 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914400/extras/6267ede8dcd990e2aad1cc4378ae80b2.webm?t=1781620033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914400/extras/6267ede8dcd990e2aad1cc4378ae80b2.mp4?t=1781620033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Abnormality mode&quot;, you face many variety of abnormalities, for example, an eruption, shooting stars, or space travel. 30+ abnormalities await your challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Chestnuts mode&quot;,  obstacle chestnuts spawn over time, you need to cook up fast or a pot will be filled uneatable annoying barbed nuts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Pile up mode&quot; has no pot, but just a scaffold. Be careful not to drop off foods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Magnet mode&quot; where foods are dropped onto a rotating magnet instead of a pot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;No item mode&quot;, you have to cook a hot pot without any items help.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914400/extras/eadda3d097c134b7bdec5c61ac4e7f66.poster.avif?t=1781620033\" width=680 height=660 ><source src=\"https: